  m_text: "You transmit an urgent warning: turn east immediately.\n\nNorth Sea Seven
    changes course and clears the reefs. The radio transmission drains the lighthouse's
    last reserve of power.\n\nLightning strikes the tower again. Part of the structure
    collapses, blocking the escape route.\n\nIn the dark control room, the radio
    crackles:\n\u201CWE'RE SAFE... BUT ARE YOU STILL THERE?\u201D\n\nThe lighthouse
    goes dark. The ship is safe, but you are trapped inside."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
