      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The lighthouse's main beam suddenly flares to life. A powerful shaft of
    light cuts through the storm, illuminating the sea and the dangerous reefs.\n\nNorth
    Sea Seven sees the beacon and changes course in time, passing safely beside the
    rocks.\n\nThe captain's voice comes through the radio:\n\u201CWE SEE THE LIGHT.
    THANK YOU, LIGHTHOUSE KEEPER.\u201D\n\nThe storm begins to weaken, and the first
    light of dawn appears on the horizon.\n\nThe ship is saved. You remain safe at
    the lighthouse."
